<title>NIGERIA: Costain West Africa raises Q3 profit.</title>
<headline>Costain West Africa raises Q3 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for construction company Costain West Africa to end-June 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Turnover			742.9  vs  449.8</p>
<p>Profit before taxation     35.8  vs   24.4</p>
<p>Taxation			  6.0  vs    4.1</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	29.7  vs   20.3</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
